# Panes - dolphin (actions/dolphin/dolphin_panes.kbd)
**panes + ent**      -- Pane Max ([f9] [f11])
**panes + h**        -- Pane Toggle (tab)
**panes + l**        -- Pane Toggle (tab)
**panes + up**       -- Pane Toggle (tab)
**panes + j**        -- Pane Toggle (tab)
**panes + -**        -- Pane Split (f3)
**panes + \**        -- Pane Split (f3)
**panes + w**        -- Close Tab (C-w)
**panes + toggle**   -- Pane Toggle (tab)
**panes + s**        -- Toggle Left Sidebar (f9)
**panes + lsft + s** -- Toggle Right Sidebar (f11)
**panes + g**        -- Focus Address Bar (C-p C-l)
**panes + m**        -- Focus Main (C-l C-p C-p)
